          </p>

          <p>
            Cost per 25 g is the only fair way to compare shakes with different protein counts. The formula is the price divided by the total grams of protein in the pack, multiplied by 25. For the Premier 12-pack that is $26.74 divided by 360 g, times 25, which gives $1.86. Run the same sum on any shake at any store and you can compare it directly with the table below.
