            Premier Protein and Muscle Milk are closer than ever after Muscle Milk's 2026 reformulation. Premier is still the leaner shake, with 30 g of protein, 1 g of sugar and 4 g of carbs in 160 calories, and it adds 24 vitamins and minerals. Muscle Milk is now the simpler shake, built on ultra-filtered milk with stevia instead of sucralose, and at the Amazon prices we saw it was cheaper per 25 g of protein in cartons.
